---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GeneProgramExplorer from '../components/GeneProgramExplorer';
---

<Base
  title="Gene programs"
  description="Explore covarying gene programs and their pairwise correlation structure across the atlas."
>
  <section class="section container">
    <div class="head prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Gene programs</p>
      <h1>Programs of covarying genes</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Genes were grouped into programs whose expression covaries locally
        along the lineage tree (using{' '}
        <a href="https://hotspot.readthedocs.io/en/latest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hotspot</a>).
        The heatmap shows the local correlation between every pair of genes;
        colored strips mark each gene's program. Choose a program from the
        dropdown, or click its strip, to zoom in and see individual gene
        names alongside its UMAP, description, and full gene list.
      </p>
    </div>

    <GeneProgramExplorer client:load />
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .head {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
